### Third-Party Data & Component Notices

1. **Project PLATEAU 3D City Model (Shibuya-ku 2025)**
   - Source: Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism of Japan (MLIT / 国土交通省)
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   - URL: https://www.mlit.go.jp/plateau/
   - Note: Building footprints and heights were extracted, transformed into local projected coordinates, and simplified for procedural WebGL rendering.

2. **OpenStreetMap Geographic Data**
   - Source: © OpenStreetMap contributors
   - License: Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL 1.0)
   - URL: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
   - Note: Road alignments and carriageway classifications were filtered and simplified.

3. **Three.js (r125)**
   - Copyright (c) 2010-2026 Three.js authors
   - License: MIT License
   - URL: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js

4. **Web Fonts (Google Fonts)**
   - M PLUS Rounded 1c: Copyright (c) 2018 Coji Morishita, M+ Fonts Project (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
